comment6.target=void\ assignLetterTargets(java.lang.String)
comment6.text=\n\ Assigns\ each\ boid\ a\ pixel\ in\ the\ rasterised\ word\ and\n\ enters\ \u201Cpose\u201D\ mode\ for\ SETTLE_FRAMES\ frames.\n\n\ @param\ word\ \ uppercase\ word\ to\ form\n
